        "defense": null,
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You unleash a cone of thematic emojis. Choose a type of emoji you spray, which determines the effects of the spell. Each creature in the area experiences the chosen effect.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Eye Emojis</strong> Bright eyes cling to the creature, which must attempt a Fortitude save. Emoji spray gains the light and visual traits.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is distracted by the light, becoming @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the creature can't benefit from the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Concealed] condition and takes a –2 circumstance penalty to Stealth checks to [[/act hide]] for as long as it's off-guard.</p></li><li><p><strong>Food Emojis</strong> Food gets into the creature's circuits. The creature must succeed at a Reflex save or the creature and one tech item of your choice that it's holding becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Glitching]{Glitching 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Glitching]{Glitching 2} on a critical failure).</p></li><li><p><strong>Grawlix Emojis</strong> Symbols representing profanity barrage the creature, dealing 2d4 mental damage (basic Will save); on a failure, it also becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3} on a critical failure). Emoji spray gains the mental trait.</p></li><li><p><strong>Weapon Emojis</strong> Swords and daggers pierce the creature, dealing 1d6 persistent bleed damage (basic Reflex save) as the weapons tear into it.</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The mental damage increases by 2d4, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
        },
